<https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ar6-cid#AgriculturalAndEcologicalDrought> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Episodic combination of soil moisture supply deficit and atmospheric demand requirements that challenges the vegetation's ability to meet its water needs for transpiration and growth. Note: 'agricultural' vs. 'ecological' term depends on affected biome." .
<https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ar6-cid#MeanPrecipitation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Mean precipitation and its diurnal and seasonal cycles." .
