<https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ar6-cid#SevereWindStorm> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Episodic severe storms including extratropical cyclone wind storms, thunderstorms, wind gusts, derechos and tornadoes." .
<https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ar6-cid#Landslide> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ground and atmospheric conditions that lead to geological mass movements, including landslide, mudslide and rockfall." .
