<https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ar6-cid#Permafrost> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Permanently frozen deep soil layers, their ice characteristics, and the characteristics of seasonally frozen soils above." .
<https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ar6-cid#OceanSalinity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Profile of ocean salinity and associated seasonal stratification. Note: distinct from salinization of freshwater resources" .
<https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ar6-cid#HeavyPrecipitationAndPluvialFlood> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "High rates of precipitation and resulting episodic, localized flooding of streams and flat lands." .
